{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.logCodeQualityEntryIf\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">logCodeQualityEntryIf</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Options.html#Lean.MonadOptions\">MonadOptions</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.MonadEnv\">MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">linterOption</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Options.html#Lean.Option\">Lean.Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/CodeQuality/Basic.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQuality.Entry\">CodeQuality.Entry</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Similar to `logLintIf`, but for `logCodeQualityEntry` - i.e. it logs an entry only if the\nprovided linter option is enabled, taking `linter.all` and linter sets into account. The entry\nis recorded with `linterOption.name` as its attribution, so consumers can filter it by linter\nselection (e.g. `lake lint --lint-only`).\n","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.logCodeQualityEntryIf","kind":"def","line":103,"name":"Lean.Linter.logCodeQualityEntryIf","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L103-L112"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.logCodeQualityEntry\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">logCodeQualityEntry</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.MonadEnv\">MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/CodeQuality/Basic.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQuality.Entry\">CodeQuality.Entry</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Records the code quality entry `e` into `codeQualityLogExt` so that it is persisted into the\n`.olean` and can be recovered by consumers via `getAllCodeQualityEntries`.\n\nThis can be safely used in Linters. While regular `Lean.Linter`s, module linters, and stateful\nlinters all have their environment changes discarded after running, entries they log are\ncaptured per command (see `Command.State.codeQualityEntryTasks`) and merged into the final\nenvironment in `runFrontend`.\n\nThe entry is recorded without a linter attribution, so it is recorded unconditionally and no\nlinter selection flag (e.g. `lake lint --lint-only`) can suppress it. Inside a linter guarded by\nan option, use `logCodeQualityEntryIf` instead; this variant is meant for unconditional metrics\nnot tied to any linter option.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.logCodeQualityEntry","kind":"def","line":85,"name":"Lean.Linter.logCodeQualityEntry","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L85-L101"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.recordLints\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">recordLints</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fileMap</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Position.html#Lean.FileMap\">FileMap</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">commandLints</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageLog\">MessageLog</a>)</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#BaseIO\">BaseIO</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Records linter warnings and looks up positions of their associated commands from a build\ninto `lintLogExt` so that consumers (e.g. `lake lint`) can recover them from the `.olean`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.recordLints","kind":"def","line":65,"name":"Lean.Linter.recordLints","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L65-L83"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.instMonadFileMapReaderTFileMapBaseIO\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">instMonadFileMapReaderTFileMapBaseIO</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Position.html#Lean.MonadFileMap\">MonadFileMap</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ReaderT\">ReaderT</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Position.html#Lean.FileMap\">FileMap</a> <a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#BaseIO\">BaseIO</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.instMonadFileMapReaderTFileMapBaseIO","kind":"instance","line":63,"name":"Lean.Linter.instMonadFileMapReaderTFileMapBaseIO","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L63-L63"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.getAllCodeQualityEntries\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">getAllCodeQualityEntries</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry\">CodeQualityLogEntry</a></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.getAllCodeQualityEntries","kind":"def","line":59,"name":"Lean.Linter.getAllCodeQualityEntries","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L59-L61"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.codeQualityLogExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">codeQualityLogExt</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.PersistentEnvExtension\">PersistentEnvExtension</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry\">CodeQualityLogEntry</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry\">CodeQualityLogEntry</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry\">CodeQualityLogEntry</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.codeQualityLogExt","kind":"opaque","line":49,"name":"Lean.Linter.codeQualityLogExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L49-L57"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.entry\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">CodeQualityLogEntry</span>.<span class=\"name\">entry</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry\">CodeQualityLogEntry</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Linter/CodeQuality/Basic.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQuality.Entry\">CodeQuality.Entry</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.entry","kind":"def","line":47,"name":"Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.entry","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L47-L47"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.linter?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">CodeQualityLogEntry</span>.<span class=\"name\">linter?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry\">CodeQualityLogEntry</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.linter?","kind":"def","line":46,"name":"Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.linter?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L46-L46"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">CodeQualityLogEntry</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Linter/CodeQuality/Basic.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQuality.Entry\">Lean.Linter.CodeQuality.Entry</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry\">Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.mk","kind":"ctor","line":39,"name":"Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L39-L47"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">CodeQualityLogEntry</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A code quality entry recorded into `codeQualityLogExt`, together with the option name of the\nlinter that produced it. Entries logged via `logCodeQualityEntryIf` carry their linter's option\nname, which consumers use to filter by linter selection (e.g. `lake lint --lint-only`); entries\nlogged via `logCodeQualityEntry` carry `none` and are exempt from such filtering.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry","kind":"structure","line":39,"name":"Lean.Linter.CodeQualityLogEntry","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L39-L47"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.getAllLints\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">getAllLints</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.LintEntry\">LintEntry</a></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.html#Lean.Linter.getAllLints","kind":"def","line":35,"name":"Lean.Linter.getAllLints","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Linter/PersistentLintLog.lean#L35-L37"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\"